# --- Rendered output and inputs ---------------------------------------------
# Artifact HTML and the PDFs made from it often hold private data. Keep them
# out of the repo by default; commit a deliberate test fixture by adding it
# under tests/fixtures/, which is re-included below.
*.pdf
*.html
*.htm
!tests/fixtures/**/*.html
!tests/fixtures/**/*.pdf
artifact-files/
out/
output/
scratch/
scratchpad/

